## Installation

1. Install [Node.js](https://nodejs.org) if you don't have it already.

2. Clone Vencord:
   ```bash
   git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/Vendicated/Vencord.git
   cd Vencord
Copy the graphtech folder from this repo into Vencord/src/userplugins/graphtech.
Install dependencies and build:
npx pnpm install
npx pnpm build
Inject Vencord into your Discord client:
npx pnpm inject
Fully quit and restart Discord.
Go to User Settings → Vencord → Plugins, search for GraphTech, and enable it.
